{"story":{"id":"site-larion-digsite","title":{"zh":"信号","en":"The Signal"},"category":"precursors","kind":"site","image":"art/26a20ed1dc121a360d63.webp","start":"archaeological_site_types:larion_digsite","chapters":10,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"我们自[From.Planet.GetName]的偏远山谷捕捉到了一束独特的信号。由于信号源离这颗星球上的任何已存在文明都十分遥远，追踪这束信号、搞清楚它的来源，或许会有特殊意义。","en":"We have picked up a unique signal from a remote valley on [From.Planet.GetName]. As the signal's source is far away from any civilization that has existed on the planet, it might be of interest to track it down and figure out where it is coming from."},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"archaeological_site_types:larion_digsite","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"星系生成","en":"Galaxy generation"}]},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"unique.1","parent":"n1","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/06_overlord_arc_sites.txt:109"},"children":["n3"]},"n3":{"doc":"unique.5","parent":"n2","via":{"kind":"stage","hooks":["stage"],"source":"common/archaeological_site_types/06_overlord_arc_sites.txt"},"children":["n4"]},"n4":{"doc":"unique.10","parent":"n3","via":{"kind":"stage","hooks":["stage"],"source":"common/archaeological_site_types/06_overlord_arc_sites.txt"},"children":["n5"]},"n5":{"doc":"unique.15","parent":"n4","via":{"option":"unique.10.b","optionIndex":1,"kind":"option","source":"events/unique_system_events.txt:178"},"children":["n6","n7","n8","n9"]},"n6":{"doc":"unique.16","parent":"n5","via":{"option":"unique.15.a","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/unique_system_events.txt:218"},"children":[]},"n7":{"doc":"unique.17","parent":"n5","via":{"option":"unique.15.b","optionIndex":1,"kind":"option","source":"events/unique_system_events.txt:222"},"children":[]},"n8":{"doc":"unique.18","parent":"n5","via":{"option":"unique.15.c","optionIndex":2,"kind":"option","source":"events/unique_system_events.txt:226"},"children":[]},"n9":{"doc":"unique.20","parent":"n5","via":{"option":"unique.15.d","optionIndex":3,"kind":"option","source":"events/unique_system_events.txt:230"},"children":["n10"]},"n10":{"doc":"unique.22","parent":"n9","via":{"option":"unique.20.c","optionIndex":2,"kind":"option","source":"events/unique_system_events.txt:412"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"archaeological_site_types:larion_digsite","kind":"site","title":{"zh":"信号","en":"The Signal"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们自[From.Planet.GetName]的偏远山谷捕捉到了一束独特的信号。由于信号源离这颗星球上的任何已存在文明都十分遥远，追踪这束信号、搞清楚它的来源，或许会有特殊意义。","en":"We have picked up a unique signal from a remote valley on [From.Planet.GetName]. As the signal's source is far away from any civilization that has existed on the planet, it might be of interest to track it down and figure out where it is coming from."}],"sections":[{"zh":"我们自[From.Planet.GetName]的偏远山谷捕捉到了一束独特的信号。由于信号源离这颗星球上的任何已存在文明都十分遥远，追踪这束信号、搞清楚它的来源，或许会有特殊意义。","en":"We have picked up a unique signal from a remote valley on [From.Planet.GetName]. As the signal's source is far away from any civilization that has existed on the planet, it might be of interest to track it down and figure out where it is coming from."}],"image":"art/26a20ed1dc121a360d63.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"unique.1","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/06_overlord_arc_sites.txt:109","hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"story":"site-larion-digsite"},{"target":"ancrel.8000","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0002,"group":"r29822","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:2","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"event-ancrel-8000"},{"target":"ancrel.8001","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0011,"group":"r29822","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:3"